{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>英偉達CFO克雷斯</p>\n<p>知情人士稱，英偉達全體董事會尚未做出決定，但公司董事計劃於周三晚間開會。Semafor此前證實，英偉達董事會準備最早於周三罷免CEO黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)。此前，《紐約時報》報道了黃仁勳的第二段婚外情。</p>\n<p>一名美國政府高級官員表示，英偉達董事會已就計劃召開的會議向白宮作了通報。</p>\n<p>另據彭博社報道，知情人士稱，英偉達董事目前正在遠程開會，討論黃仁勳的去留。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1112/816a49184af149f.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>英偉達CFO克雷斯</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:04:04.024016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:50:50.857338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:57:17.651873+00:00","content_hash":"bf12a0bfa10e662bf48d0dc1118a2c6368c9cdc3d0ab5b306859439a78b40098","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:04:04.024016+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}